Subject: [PATCH 07/10] hunt stress0: the minimal form over public API, its
 forced schedule, and a loop over binaries of several commits

The scenario and the snapshot phase are repeated over public API only, so
the same file builds at older commits; the forced form holds the forms
publisher between its slot swaps and its store of the position and scans
the snapshot there. The loop runs the binaries of several commits in turn
so the host's load is shared by all of them.

